Thought it might be a good time to send out a reminder about the
libunwind project: it has been making steady progress and there is now
even a web site and the beginning of documentation.  So, if you have
an application that needs unwind support, check it out at:

	http://www.hpl.hp.com/research/linux/libunwind/

I should say the implementation isn't completely done yet, but it's
getting close.

Enjoy,

